<title>BELGIUM: Ostend airport air cargo traffic dips in October.</title>
<headline>Ostend airport air cargo traffic dips in October.</headline>
<dateline>OSTEND 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend Airport has seen a slight dip in air cargo traffic in October, compared to the same month last year, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>One of the main reasons for the fall was a late green bean season. Ostend handles green beans coming in from Egypt, and this year the crop was very late starting, she added.</p>
<p>				  Oct 1996	 Sept 96	  Oct 95</p>
<p>Airfreight			6,613	   5,741	    7,238</p>
<p>volumes tonnes</p>
<p>Aircraft			  2,346	   3,090	    3,102</p>
<p>movements</p>
<p>Passenger			 5,443	   8,974	    6,784</p>
<p>traffic</p>
